+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2HRG6MFKWJ6366XQZDYKHDW","recordedAt":"2026-09-15T02:47:35Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.AA.S17"],"title":"MCP HTTP transport endpoint ships without authentication or rate limiting","description":"At commit aaa72a040db4c32f3d6488d5e28e2892a68e9ee0 the gateway's HTTP transport exposes POST/GET/DELETE /mcp with no authentication by default: the only mechanism is exact-match validation of the operator-configured httpHeaders map which defaults to an empty object (src/common/config/userConfig.ts:136-143), there is no rate limiter, no 429/409 handling, no TLS in the express app, and with externallyManagedSessions=true a client-supplied mcp-session-id creates a session without authentication (src/transports/mcpHttpServer.ts:306-419). The optional monitoring server exposes /health and /metrics unauthenticated (src/transports/monitoring.ts:53-79). Deployed to prod (eks-prod-mumbai, exposure partner, pii+financial), any in-cluster caller can call every enabled tool against the client-data and order stores. No gateway policy exists in the repo.","methods":["probe-schemas"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-15T02:47:35Z","expiresAt":"2026-10-15T02:47:35Z","result":"not-satisfied","toolOutput":{"format":"sarif","path":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/opencode/run_01M2GDZ3Q3S5WYCB3MV02QJXZ1.probe-schemas.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","sha256":"8eb156acade64a5455e26dd6be4125d22283d4c7c53ea66576ccdc9864dcadb3"},"evidence":[{"type":"sarif","ref":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/opencode/run_01M2GDZ3Q3S5WYCB3MV02QJXZ1.probe-schemas.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","description":"SCH-API-01 result","sha256":"8eb156acade64a5455e26dd6be4125d22283d4c7c53ea66576ccdc9864dcadb3"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server.json","description":"audited commit aaa72a040db4c32f3d6488