+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2K7B0MGN03WM0T8X8C9WZTT","recordedAt":"2026-09-15T15:14:31Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.AA.S2"],"title":"Loopback default with exposure warning, undermined by the deploy config and unrestricted connect tools","description":"The HTTP transport defaults to binding 127.0.0.1 (userConfig.ts:131-135) and logs an explicit security warning when asked to bind wider addresses (src/transports/streamableHttp.ts:156-160, 242-249). However the shipped AWS deployment binds 0.0.0.0 unauthenticated (deploy/aws/Dockerfile:17), the Azure bicep default is NOAUTH with external ingress (deploy/azure/bicep/main.bicep:48-53, 151-156), and the connect and switch-connection tools let the model steer the session to arbitrary hosts with no egress allow-list, so network segmentation of the agent surface is not enforced.","methods":["probe-agent-graph"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-15T15:14:31Z","expiresAt":"2026-10-15T15:14:31Z","result":"partial","toolOutput":{"format":"sarif","path":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/opencode/run_01M2GDZ3Q3S5WYCB3MV02QJXZ1.probe-agent-graph.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","sha256":"c3c7b9dc736d1407d3a96f196cc75bf759aeb1756332fa0e4691fca51f59a10e"},"evidence":[{"type":"sarif","ref":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/opencode/run_01M2GDZ3Q3S5WYCB3MV02QJXZ1.probe-agent-graph.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","sha256":"c3c7b9dc736d1407d3a96f196cc75bf759aeb1756332fa0e4691fca51f59a10e","description":"results 1 and 6"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/deploy/azure/bicep/main.bicep","description":"authMode default NOAUTH, ingress external true"}],"tags":["agentic","static-probe"],"provenance":{"harness":"opencode","generatedAt":"2026-09-15T15:14:31Z","sessionId":"453ecc6e-1346-418f-a2c0-1bfcead851c3","runId":"run_01M2GDZ3Q3S5WYCB3MV02QJXZ1","work