+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2KBJW4A17Q0HZKNN46BVCEJ","recordedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.MA.S3"],"title":"V15 Secure Coding and Architecture: agent output handling present; dependency review inconclusive","description":"No unsafe deserialisation (EJSON/bson parsing is data-only), no eval/Function/vm on untrusted strings, and no shell execution reachable from the transport (the setup CLI exec at src/setup/aiTool.ts:259 is an interactive local tool over a fixed home-directory path). Agent-code lenses: untrusted DB content is tag-wrapped before entering model context (src/tools/tool.ts:967-994), mitigating LLM01 prompt injection and LLM05 improper output handling; the confirmation fail-open is reported under V2 (LLM06/ASI02). Dependency vulnerabilities: inconclusive - node_modules is not installed in the checkout and no offline vulnerability database is available (no scanner executor), so pnpm-lock.yaml versions could not be confirmed against a CVE database; PR.MA.S3 and PW.4.4 apply once a scanner DB exists.","methods":["execute-scr"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","expiresAt":"2026-10-15T19:42:44Z","result":"partial","evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/src/tools/tool.ts","sha256":"710324a9ac625baf40b786107520129c3672ec10deb7884f79e7202f370234f1","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"agent output wrapping lines 967-994; redacting handleError 813-829"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/src/setup/aiTool.ts","sha256":"dddaa5895f9b85331ce11e51015340149c95500ab961099ad47b96e58f155640","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"local interactive exec over fixed path, lines 238-268"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server.json","sha256