+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2KC7W3PJ0MSVHBASECMMZM8","recordedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.IP.S6"],"title":"V16 Security Logging and Error Handling: no logging pipeline or error-leakage surface","description":"The module defines no logger and writes no log record anywhere, so no PII, credentials, headers or tokens can be logged by this code. The only error handling, fetch_notif_as_dict at models.py:449-473, catches broadly and degrades to empty placeholder strings rather than returning stack traces, SQL errors or internal hostnames to any caller; the broad exception swallowing can hide data errors but leaks nothing. Audit-event generation (logins, MFA events, admin actions) belongs to the services that import these models, not the schema library, so the chapter is not-applicable at this layer; SARIF pass result asvs-v16-error-leakage.","methods":["execute-scr"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"db-models","repoId":"onfinance-db-model-master"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","expiresAt":"2026-10-15T19:42:44Z","result":"not-applicable","evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py","sha256":"7f6eb5d6f2beb71e698ada8a80adaee08fb316afe8d9ed3c25238e33ba46b553","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"lines 441-477 at 70b3633: fetch_notif_as_dict returns empty placeholders on failure"},{"type":"sarif","ref":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/opencode/453ecc6e-1346-418f-a2c0-1bfcead851c3.execute-scr.db-models.onfinance-db-model-master.sarif.export.json","sha256":"34cdbb5601170c9c81efd702b13f8a36f28b684ed8fad2357266389e81454831","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"pass result asvs-v16-error-leakage"}],"tags":["scr","scr:v16"],"provenance":{"harness":"opencode","generatedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","sessionId":"453ecc6e-1346-418f-a2c0-1bfcead851c3","runId":"run_01M2GDZ3Q3S5WYCB3MV02