al storage - which is how the existing cleartext-credential design (ledger finding fnd_01M2KC7W3QM0V86PVA3SVA01FN) reached master unchallenged.\n\nRemediation: Add .github/pull_request_template.md with a security and data-impact checklist (does the change touch pii/spdi/financial fields, credentials, retention or access control; DPDP impact; rollback plan) and make it the default for PRs to master; pair it with branch protection requiring 1 approval once branchProtection is captured.\n\nSource: maxwell-sdlc-auditor rule ssdf-pw-7-1-no-pr-security-checklist; agent analysis of the repo record and checkout, with the probe-sdlc SARIF export in evidence."}
