+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2KM42DZ98VAGYD0E8TRV3FQ","recordedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","companyId":"example-co","title":"Agentic-workflows agent file tells developers AI agents run full bash and edit by default and should not be restricted","description":".github/agents/agentic-workflows.agent.md documents that gh-aw workflows run in the Agent Workflow Firewall sandbox with \"full `bash` and `edit` tools by default\" (line 184) and instructs \"Bash tools are enabled by default - Don't restrict bash commands unnecessarily since workflows are sandboxed by the AWF\" (line 191), i.e. AI agents on this repo operate with shell and file edits auto-approved. The company aiCodingPolicy requires humanReviewRequired true and promptInjectionControls [tool-allowlist, human-approval-for-writes] (company-profile/example-co/sdlc/policy.json lines 80-84), and no compensating approval gate exists in the Copilot instruction files. Severity is the catalog defaultSeverity of sebi-cscrf-2024 PR.AA.S3 (high).\n\nImpact: Agentic workflows triggered from issues or PRs on this repo execute arbitrary shell and edits with no human approval, defeating the tool-allowlist and human-approval-for-writes controls on an AI-facing repository that is itself an MCP server product; prompt-injected workflow content could run commands in the agent sandbox (OWASP Agentic Top 10 2026 ASI02 tool misuse; SEBI CSCRF PR.AA.S3 least privilege).\n\nRemediation: Restrict gh-aw tool grants to an explicit allowlist, require human approval for write tools in the workflow firewall policy, and rewrite the agent instructions to recommend restricting bash rather than enabling it by default.","severity":"high","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.AA.S3"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.AA.S3"},{"regulator":"OWASP","instrument":"owasp-agentic-top10-2026","controlId":"ASI02"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"},"location":{"path":".github/agents/agentic-workflows.agent.md","startLine":184,"endLine":191},"fingerprint":"de553281293ba7a7daa61793ac3f686c1374cf3d8a0b6a489cc51061e1c7ec3f","source":{"kind":"agent-analysis","ruleId":"devenv-harness-auto-approve","tool":"devenv-auditor"},"status":"open","slaDueAt":"2026-09-22T19:42:44Z","slaBasis":{"instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.MA.S3","topic":"patch-sla","severity":"high","days":7},"relatedObservationIds":["obs_01M2KM42DYNG2Z6PQVZ5CDJVP6"],"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/.github/agents/agentic-workflows.agent.md","sha256":"a8dedd5827c901a8943425cd27386c011fec6c4372f91e29d1f3e23a8334e202","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"lines 184 and 191: full bash and edit enabled by default, do not restrict bash"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"company-profile/example-co/sdlc/policy.json","sha256":"e92e455ff786a63021d80925ebeb905f4b8cf16ba106ac77ed361322ef627d06","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"humanReviewRequired true; promptInjectionControls tool-allowlist, human-approval-for-writes"},{"type":"sarif","ref":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/opencode/ses_f58f05807ffemeqmwEIgiTcwms.probe-dev-env.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","sha256":"1b6b1514955693fb1e0e4788a73b1bc303a2b14cc39a5951da8b4fd79019e5da","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z"}],"tags":["dev-env","dev-env:ai-harness-config"],"provenance":{"harness":"opencode","generatedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","sessionId":"ses_f58f05807ffemeqmwEIgiTcwms","runId":"run_01M2GDZ3Q3S5WYCB3MV02QJXZ1","workflow":"execute-scr","agent":"soc-ledger-keeper"}}
+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2KM42DZE09A2PZ557A7SX2F","recordedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","companyId":"example-co","title":".gitignore ignores only the exact name .env, leaving .env* variants and key files trackable in a public repo","description":".gitignore line 8 contains only `.env`, so .env.local, .env.development, .env.staging and other .env* variants are not ignored, nor are *.pem, *.key, kubeconfig or dump extensions. The repo's own .vscode/launch.json loads ${workspaceFolder}/.env for its Debug Tests and Debug generate-release-notes configurations, and the server takes credentials through MDB_MCP_CONNECTION_STRING, so developers will hold env files with live connection strings; the repo visibility is public, so a stray `git add` publishes them. The tracked tests/integration/fixtures/server.key and server.pem are deliberate self-signed test fixtures and would need explicit negation lines after widening the patterns. Severity is the catalog defaultSeverity of sebi-cscrf-2024 PR.DS.S4 (high).\n\nImpact: Live MongoDB connection strings or API keys in .env.local or stray *.pem/*.key files would be committed by default in a public repository; the company gitleaks CI gate (blocking at low) would catch only recognisable patterns after the fact and the local hook scans AWS patterns only, so the PR.DS.S4 data-leak-prevention control is weakened at the developer layer.\n\nRemediation: Add `.env*` (with `!.env.example`), `*.pem`, `*.key` (with negations for the tracked test fixtures), `kubeconfig*` and dump extensions (*.sql, *.dump, *.sqlite*) to .gitignore, and add a pre-commit gitleaks run alongside git-secrets.","severity":"high","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.DS.S4"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.DS.S4"},{"regulator":"NIST","instrument":"nist-ssdf-800-218","controlId":"PO.5.2"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"},"location":{"path":".gitignore","startLine":7,"endLine":11},"fingerprint":"697c7563542c4c10dcab892a56071b07e4e4d388662c66616bccd27b53d49f85","source":{"kind":"agent-analysis","ruleId":"devenv-gitignore-gaps","tool":"devenv-auditor"},"status":"open","slaDueAt":"2026-09-22T19:42:44Z","slaBasis":{"instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.MA.S3","topic":"patch-sla","severity":"high","days":7},"relatedObservationIds":["obs_01M2KM42DTR4YX8F7F0GDPB7QP"],"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/.gitignore","sha256":"ac54b204537e84c23f89a039d7663d6bcc8adfde934b21c0c0bb897bb46e1faa","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"line 8: only `.env`; no .env*, *.pem, *.key, kubeconfig, dump patterns"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/.vscode/launch.json","sha256":"c0659c1417eb125d2a2b222ce940147335ee924cb61425d5552158101e6115eb","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"envFile ${workspaceFolder}/.env in two debug configs"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server.json","sha256":"d4ab134d1fe5c6331810a9aa70d57bd817118ef7f334dca1dda6aed30e8305e5","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"repo record: visibility public"},{"type":"sarif","ref":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/opencode/ses_f58f05807ffemeqmwEIgiTcwms.probe-dev-env.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","sha256":"1b6b1514955693fb1e0e4788a73b1bc303a2b14cc39a5951da8b4fd79019e5da","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z"}],"tags":["dev-env","dev-env:secrets-hygiene"],"provenance":{"harness":"opencode","generatedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","sessionId":"ses_f58f05807ffemeqmwEIgiTcwms","runId":"run_01M2GDZ3Q3S5WYCB3MV02QJXZ1","workflow":"execute-scr","agent":"soc-ledger-keeper"}}
