+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2KMNHPKKK5K3C1EYGED2KGG","recordedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","companyId":"example-co","title":"db-models/onfinance-db-model-master: no lockfile for the setup.py manifest although the SDLC policy requires lockfiles","description":"setup.py is the only package manifest (repo record packageManifests [setup.py]) and no lockfile is committed: git -C applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master ls-files at HEAD 70b3633e171a1b8d389b27bb901c84c34a0e9bf6 lists exactly 4 files (.gitignore, setup.py, onfinance_db_model_master/__init__.py, onfinance_db_model_master/models.py) with no requirements.txt with hashes, Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock or uv.lock. setup.py line 19 pins only the direct dependency mongoengine==0.24.1, so the transitive dependency tree is resolved from PyPI at install time on every developer machine. company-profile/example-co/sdlc/policy.json dependencyPolicy.lockfilesRequired is true (line 61). The inline SDLC probe of this same execute-scr run already recorded this gap as observation obs_01M2KGVJJ29HTJG9C9GEJ7ZCFW (result not-satisfied, controlIds sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.DS.S6) and no finding with a developer-environment ruleId exists at this path in the ledger (the 3 open findings for this repo carry ruleIds asvs-v14-sensitive-storage, ssdf-pw-8-2-test-gate-not-enforced and ssdf-pw-7-1-no-pr-security-checklist at other paths), so this finding raises the developer-environment rule for the same gap. Severity is the catalog defaultSeverity of sebi-cscrf-2024 PR.DS.S6.\n\nImpact: Installs of this public-visibility repository are not reproducible: the transitive set beneath mongoengine==0.24.1 is whatever pypi.org serves at install time, so a compromised or typosquotted transitive package would be picked up silently on developer laptops and by every consuming service; the dependencyPolicy patch SLAs (critical 7, high 30, medium 90 days) have no pinned baseline to scan or enforce against. SLA topic: patch-sla.\n\nRemediation: Commit a lockfile for the manifest - a hash-locked requirements.txt (installed with pip --require-hashes), or a poetry.lock or uv.lock - and install with pip --require-hashes / pip sync / uv sync --frozen in every developer and CI workflow so the whole dependency tree is pinned and verified.","severity":"high","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.DS.S6"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.DS.S6"},{"regulator":"NIST","instrument":"nist-ssdf-800-218","controlId":"PW.4.1"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"db-models","repoId":"onfinance-db-model-master"},"location":{"path":"setup.py","startLine":19,"endLine":19},"fingerprint":"a840b5ca2d051a056982a2afeb363f846ee88d3797a52f264c999eff10f59cf8","source":{"kind":"agent-analysis","ruleId":"devenv-missing-lockfile","tool":"devenv-auditor"},"status":"open","slaDueAt":"2026-09-22T19:42:44Z","slaBasis":{"instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.MA.S3","topic":"patch-sla","severity":"high","days":7},"relatedObservationIds":["obs_01M2KMNHPJTMNR2BWD72H5RB6K"],"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/setup.py","sha256":"13c1e68d74d84cd7be239cc2dafec49aebf52c31f4f5048794609cd71d2c11d6","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"line 19 install_requires [mongoengine==0.24.1]"},{"type":"command-output","ref":"git -C applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master ls-files","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"no lockfile among the 4 tracked files"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"company-profile/example-co/sdlc/policy.json","sha256":"e92e455ff786a63021d80925ebeb905f4b8cf16ba106ac77ed361322ef627d06","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"line 61 lockfilesRequired true"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master.json","sha256